@startuml
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Radiotherapy {
  subject : CancerPatient [1..1]
  cancerConditionAtDiagnosisReference : Reference(CancerConditionAtDiagnosis) [1..1]
  clinicalCancerProgresionReference : Reference(ClinicalCancerProgression) [0..1]
  intent : codeableConcept [1..1]
  startDate : dateTime [1..1]
  endDate : dateTime [0..1]
  bodySite : codeableConcept [1..*]
  setting : codeableConcept [0..1]
}

note left of Radiotherapy::intent
Choice: Definitive | Palliative 
end note
note left of Radiotherapy::setting
Choice: Alone |  Preoperative/Neoadjuvant 
| Postoperative/Adjuvant | Concomitant
end note
@enduml
